Line 55 in the PATCH handler currently has:
`if (duration_minutes !== undefined) updateData.duration_minutes = duration_minutes ? Number(duration_minutes) : null;`

The problem is that `0` is falsy in JavaScript, so `duration_minutes = 0` gets stored as `null`.

